1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.659
Two-step story sums

2
00:00:01.659 --> 00:00:29.309
Namaste! Aaj ka lesson hai Two-step story sums. Kuch sawaalon mein pehle total banta hai, phir us total ko groups mein baantna hota hai. Is baat ko dheere-dheere samjhenge, phir ek aasaan example dekhenge. Learning mein galti hona bilkul normal hai; hum har step ko dobara check kar sakte hain.

3
00:00:29.309 --> 00:01:00.276
4 dabbon mein 12 crayons har ek hain; 8 bachchon mein barabar baantoge to har ek ko 6 milenge. Dhyaan do ki example mein kaunsi cheez badal rahi hai aur kaunsi same rehti hai. Pehle apna andaaza bolo, phir reason dhoondo. Agar tum kisi dost ko samjha sakte ho, to concept aur mazboot ho jaata hai.

4
00:01:00.276 --> 00:01:32.350
Har step ke baad unit likho; isse pata chalega ki agla operation kis quantity par hoga. Apne observation ko ek sentence mein likho. Har number ya label ke saath sahi unit ya naam lagao. Sawaal solve karte waqt jaldi mat karo; clue ko underline karo, apna tareeka chuno, aur aakhir mein jawab ko example ke saath compare karo.

5
00:01:32.350 --> 00:02:48.664
